sharpening-failed = You cannot sharpen this.
sharpening-failed-blade = The weapon must have a blade.
sharpening-failed-double = The blade is already sharp.
sharpening-success = The blade has been successfully sharpened.
sharpening-roughing-begin = The blade has begun to dull.
sharpening-removed = The blade has lost its edge.
sharpening-used = The whetstone can no longer sharpen the blade.
